## 1. Business model\
\
Oden Food (oden.food) is a restaurant point-of-sale and operations SaaS for Mexico (mobile waiter app, KDS, tables, payments, online ordering). Automatic73 builds and operates the product. Paid acquisition uses Google Ads for restaurant-owner demand generation.\
\
## 2. API tool we are building\
\
An **internal, read-only** analytics assistant for engineering and ops:\
\
- Official **Google Ads MCP server** (`googleads/google-ads-mcp`) \'97 list accessible customers and run GAQL reporting queries.\
- Official **Google Analytics MCP server** (`googleanalytics/google-analytics-mcp`) \'97 traffic, events, funnels, realtime for property `oden-food`.\
- Hosted inside **Cursor** and **Claude Code** on employee machines only.\
- Credentials distributed via **Doppler** (`automatic73-ops`); no public product, no client-facing UI, no write/mutate calls (no bid changes, no campaign create/pause via API).\
\
## 3. Intended audience\
\
**Internal users only** \'97 Automatic73 / Oden employees (engineering, ops, growth). Not available to the general public or restaurant customers.\
\
## 4. Architecture (high level)\
\
```\
Employee IDE (Cursor / Claude)\
    \uc0\u8594  local MCP (stdio)\
        \uc0\u8594  Google Ads API (developer token + OAuth ADC, read-only)\
        \uc0\u8594  Google Analytics Data/Admin API (OAuth ADC, read-only)\
Secrets: Doppler automatic73-ops (token, OAuth desktop client JSON, project IDs)\
```\
\
